      "id": "mwtldaywa1sa50",
      "lineHeight": 1.25,
      "originalText": "How it could be presented",
      "seed": 676532132,
      "text": "How it could be presented",
      "textAlign": "left",
      "type": "text",
      "version": 1,
      "versionNonce": 1583616727,
      "verticalAlign": "top",
      "width": 348.28,
      "x": 0,
      "y": 1000
    },
    {
      "autoResize": false,
      "fontFamily": 6,
      "fontSize": 20,
      "height": 50,
      "id": "mwtldayz8u4g5v",
      "lineHeight": 1.25,
      "originalText": "The same checklist and celebration rules on the Org Owner's real page (1.3), presented four ways. Open the view Checklist Presentations to play with them: the dark picker at the bottom flips between them (keys 1 to 4, arrows, R replays). Card is today's version, kept as the baseline.",
      "seed": 1706618577,
      "text": "The same checklist and celebration rules on the Org Owner's real page (1.3), presented four ways. Open the view Checklist Presentations to play with them:\nthe dark picker at the bottom flips between them (keys 1 to 4, arrows, R replays). Card is today's version, kept as the baseline.",
      "textAlign": "left",
      "type": "text",
      "version": 1,
      "versionNonce": 312987978,
      "verticalAlign": "top",
      "width": 1500,
