    {
      "autoResize": false,
      "fontFamily": 6,
      "fontSize": 18,
      "height": 90,
      "id": "mwtldn90l8ned0",
      "lineHeight": 1.25,
      "originalText": "Card (today). A welcome card on top of the page; the box turns green from the last checkbox.\nRight when: the steps are the first thing someone should do here.\nCosts: it pushes the page down until it is dismissed.",
      "seed": 1593423035,
      "text": "Card (today). A welcome card on top of the page; the box turns green from the last\ncheckbox.\nRight when: the steps are the first thing someone should do here.\nCosts: it pushes the page down until it is dismissed.",
      "textAlign": "left",
      "type": "text",
      "version": 1,
      "versionNonce": 1339411941,
      "verticalAlign": "top",
      "width": 720,
      "x": 0,
      "y": 1690
    },
    {
      "autoResize": false,
      "fontFamily": 6,
      "fontSize": 18,
      "height": 112.5,
      "id": "mwtldn92p2t312",
      "lineHeight": 1.25,
      "originalText": "Dock. The welcome leaves the page and lives in a corner: it arrives open, folds into a pill whose ring fills one segment per step, and once done the pill turns green, pops and bursts.\nRight when: the steps take days and people should get on with the page meanwhile.\nCosts: easy to ignore; the welcome is less of a moment.",
      "seed": 327056827,
      "text": "Dock. The welcome leaves the page and lives in a corner: it arrives open, folds into a\npill whose ring fills one segment per step, and once done the pill turns green, pops\nand bursts.\nRight when: the steps take days and people should get on with the page meanwhile.\nCosts: easy to ignore; the welcome is less of a moment.",
      "textAlign": "left",
      "type": "text",
      "version": 1,
      "versionNonce": 348453152,
      "verticalAlign": "top",
      "width": 720,
      "x": 800,
      "y": 1690
    },
    {
      "autoResize": false,
      "fontFamily": 6,
      "fontSize": 18,
      "height": 112.5,
      "id": "mwtldn93bl1ie4",
      "lineHeight": 1.25,
      "originalText": "Trail. The steps are numbered stops on a road across the card, like a level map. Ticking fills the road; reaching the flag raises it and sweeps the card green. Optional steps sit past the flag on a dashed road.\nRight when: the steps are a sequence and the platform's game feel should show.\nCosts: wide; long step names wrap into tall labels.",
      "seed": 942832289,
      "text": "Trail. The steps are numbered stops on a road across the card, like a level map.\nTicking fills the road; reaching the flag raises it and sweeps the card green. Optional\nsteps sit past the flag on a dashed road.\nRight when: the steps are a sequence and the platform's game feel should show.\nCosts: wide; long step names wrap into tall labels.",
      "textAlign": "left",
      "type": "text",
      "version": 1,
      "versionNonce": 1097218295,
      "verticalAlign": "top",
      "width": 720,
      "x": 1600,
      "y": 1690
    },
    {
      "autoResize": false,
      "fontFamily": 6,
      "fontSize": 18,
      "height": 112.5,
      "id": "mwtldn93xm2olc",
      "lineHeight": 1.25,
      "originalText": "Focus. One step at a time, as a stack of cards: ticking throws the top card away and the next rises. Dots show every step; a green dot brings its card back. An empty stack shows a big check.\nRight when: each step deserves attention of its own, or there are many steps.\nCosts: hides what comes next; harder to see the whole list.",
      "seed": 973960156,
      "text": "Focus. One step at a time, as a stack of cards: ticking throws the top card away and\nthe next rises. Dots show every step; a green dot brings its card back. An empty\nstack shows a big check.\nRight when: each step deserves attention of its own, or there are many steps.\nCosts: hides what comes next; harder to see the whole list.",
      "textAlign": "left",
      "type": "text",
      "version": 1,
      "versionNonce": 759445464,
      "verticalAlign": "top",
      "width": 720,
      "x": 2400,
      "y": 1690
    }
  ],
